    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Feverish, tired</td></tr><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Positive</td><td>More cough, purulent sputum, more breathless; two small streaks of blood; no wheeze</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No chest pain, palpitations or ankle swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Appetite a little lower; no nausea, vomiting or diarrhea</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No drowsiness or confusion</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Mood steady; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>6 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
